{"id":"scripts/queries.mjs","pkg":"scripts","kind":"script","lines":260,"commentLines":29,"header":["scripts/queries.mjs - ONE PLACE for every question the omnibar must answer. The questions live in eval/router-acceptance.json (the file scripts/omnibar-acceptance.mjs also runs). I wrote this tool to keep that file and a readable checklist, eval/QUERIES.md, in step, so that I never edit 90 KB of JSON by hand and never keep a second list somewhere else. node scripts/queries.mjs rewrite eval/QUERIES.md (the checklist: every question, what a correct answer is, its last known result) node scripts/queries.mjs mark ID STATUS [--answer] [note ...] record a result after trying a question on screen. STATUS is one of: ok fail unknown (or the symbols ✅ ❌ ❓ ✔ 📌). --answer records the ANSWER CARD's result (the card above the circular list) instead of the search result. The note gets today's date. node scripts/queries.mjs add \"the question\" [--id ID] [--route CIRCULAR] [--area circular] [--facts \"15,000|15000; 14,999|14999\"] [--forbid \"75,000; 74,999\"] add a new question (nothing is added if the same words are already there). In --facts, \";\" separates facts that must ALL appear and \"|\" separates alternative spellings of one fact. Facts given here are the ANSWER CARD's. node scripts/queries.mjs find WORDS which questions contain these words (and their ids) node scripts/queries.mjs check look for duplicate questions, repeated ids and malformed records node scripts/queries.mjs import-session a ONE-TIME step (safe to run twice): puts what the session of 17-18 Oct 2026 found into the set (see below) node scripts/queries.mjs selftest tests of this tool on a scratch copy; touches nothing An ANSWER CARD expectation sits in a record's \"answer\": { \"facts\": [[..alternatives..], ..], \"forbidden\": [..], \"status\": \"✅\", \"note\": \"...\" }. The facts are what the card must show; I meant them for the answer stage of the acceptance run (to be added to scripts/omnibar-acceptance.mjs)."],"symbols":[{"name":"HERE","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":27,"sig":"const HERE = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"9308baf323-HERE","usedBy":[]},{"name":"ROOT","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":28,"sig":"const ROOT = path.resolve(HERE, \"..\")","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"9308baf323-ROOT","usedBy":[]},{"name":"SET","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":29,"sig":"const SET = path.join(ROOT, \"eval\", \"router-acceptance.json\")","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"9308baf323-SET","usedBy":[]},{"name":"MD","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":30,"sig":"const MD = path.join(ROOT, \"eval\", \"QUERIES.md\")","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"9308baf323-MD","usedBy":[]},{"name":"STATUS","kind":"constant","exported":false,"line":31,"sig":"const STATUS = { ok: \"✅\", fail: \"❌\", unknown: \"❓\", passed: \"✔\", computed: \"📌\", \"✅\": \"✅\", \"❌\": \"❌\", \"❓\": \"❓\", \"✔\": \"✔\", \"📌\": \"📌\" }","type":"","doc":[],"members":[{"kind":"key","name":"ok","line":31,"value":"\"✅\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"fail","line":31,"value":"\"❌\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"unknown","line":31,"value":"\"❓\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"passed","line":31,"value":"\"✔\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"computed","line":31,"value":"\"📌\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"\"✅\"","line":31,"value":"\"✅\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"\"❌\"","line":31,"value":"\"❌\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"\"❓\"","line":31,"value":"\"❓\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"\"✔\"","line":31,"value":"\"✔\"","doc":[]},{"kind":"key","name":"\"📌\"","line":31,"value":"\"📌\"","doc":[]}],"items":0,"id":"9308baf323-STATUS","usedBy":[]},{"name":"norm","kind":"function","exported":false,"line":32,"async":false,"sig":"const norm = (s) =>","params":[{"name":"s","type":"","optional":false,"rest":false,"def":""}],"returns":"","doc":[],"paramDocs":{},"returnDoc":